      {
       "id": "d09b032",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "The Ummah Builders <em>manifesto</em>",
        "header_size": "h1",
        "_css_classes": "ub-title",
        "align": "center"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "92fb68c",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "c503720",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>We want to build a strong and honest professional network for the ummah: a place where people come together to learn, to build and to help each other grow.</p>",
        "align": "center"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "01a5234",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 40,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "659d8ed",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "I. Within Islamic boundaries",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "a64a4be",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>Everything we do happens within clear Islamic boundaries: in how we treat each other, money and data.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "39941dc",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "fdfe234",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "II. Quality and knowledge",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "52f6ecf",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>We choose substance over noise. Structured conversations, a shared knowledge base and mentoring by experienced professionals.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "373ef50",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "783e0db",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "III. Real impact",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "75c512c",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>The talent within the ummah is vast but scattered. Through project groups, hackathons and shark-tank sessions we turn ideas into working projects.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "eb0677b",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "4703999",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "IV. An example for the youth",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "b4e8eda",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>We want to be positive role models, so young people do not depend on the wrong examples. Members share their career ladder so others see what is possible.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "24b5c0b",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "82a28c9",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "V. What we do not do",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "1411c35",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>No addictive algorithm, no DM culture and no misuse of data. Money that flows through the community is reported transparently.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
